}

body:json {
  {
    "email": "mrellen@example.com"
  }
}

docs {
  ## Resend Verification Email

  Sends a new verification email to the given address if it is registered
  but not yet verified. Always returns 200 to avoid leaking which emails
  are registered.

  **Body**
  | Field | Type   | Required | Description       |
  |-------|--------|----------|-------------------|
  | email | string | yes      | Registered e-mail |

  **Responses**
  - `200` — `{ message: "If your email is registered and unverified, a new link has been sent." }`
  - `400` — missing email field
}
